@host = http://localhost:5000

### Register a new organization (tenant + admin user)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@acme.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345",
  "fullName": "Demo Owner",
  "phone": "255712345678",
  "organizationName": "Acme Ltd"
}

### Login (seeded dev user)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Refresh token (replace refreshToken with a value from login)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Revoke session / logout (replace refreshToken with a value from login)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Current user (requires Bearer token)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
